License

Successful demo execution should show:

• Core Identity validation
• Candidate generation
• Rulebook filtering
• Physics Proxy validation
• Safety Veto operation
• Growth Layer updates
• Sleep/Dive optimization
• Observation Window startup

If you see EADDRINUSE on port 3000,
another process is already using the dashboard port.
The demo itself has still executed successfully.



